CompileTimeError: d23_an_operator_inside_a_join_is_refused.jern:4:26, line 4 column 26
 4 |     println("Total: " $a + $b)
   |                          ^
 what: `+` can't be used inside a join; the value it works out needs a named step first
 why:  a join holds only strings, variables, fields and `as` (D23, standard 4.3)
